«
@@ ============================================================
@@ WPAdd — add a waypoint at the end of the route.
@@
@@ Input : "name" φ λ — name, latitude and longitude (East positive).
@@         Plain numbers are degrees; angles with a unit are accepted.
@@ The route is the list stored in the variable Route of the current
@@ directory, one { "name" φ λ } list per waypoint; it is created if
@@ it does not exist yet.
@@ ============================================================

  3 →LIST 1 →LIST
  IFERR 'Route' RCL THEN DROP { } END
  SWAP + 'Route' STO
»
